    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="73">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 73</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be wydewan, þæt heo sitte XII monðas ceorlæs. And sitte ælc wuduwe werleas twelf monað ⁊ ceose heo syððan þæt heo sylf wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning widows, that they remain for a year without a husband. And every widow shall remain twelve months without a husband, and she shall afterwards choose what she herself desires.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ sitte ælc wuduwe werleas XII monað, ceose syððan þæt heo sylf wylle.</ab>
      </div>
